== Summer Practice

- Summer practice is mandatory for all students.
- It requires 360 hours (45 working days) between June 22 and September 7 (the previous year).

== Where Can I Do My Summer Practice?

+ Companies with a university agreement
+ International companies without a university agreement
+ Research projects with professors
+ Summer schools
+ Erasmus+ internships
+ Other companies without a university agreement

== How Can I Find a Summer Practice Placement?

- University site: #link("https://connect.upb.ro/")[connect.upb.ro]
- Erasmus+ internship calls: #link("https://upb.ro/erasmus/mobilitate-de-plasament-upb/")[upb.ro/erasmus]
- Stagii pe bune: #link("https://www.stagiipebune.ro/")[stagiipebune.ro]
- Find a company independently; for international opportunities: #link("https://leetcode.com/")[leetcode.com]

== Required Documents

- #link("https://acs.pub.ro/studenti/stagii-de-practica/")[ACS practice information]
- Framework agreement (company) or practice portfolio (research project)
- Practice journal describing completed work
- Practice certificate/evaluation
- Collaboration protocol between the university and company